  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "默认主链路：直连事务车道",
      "items": [
        "planDirectSyncLane 只在 queued、fastPath 开启、engine=typescript、版本一致、载荷 preserveAbsent、主库已存在时返回 direct（apps/api/src/direct-sync-plan.ts:47-56）",
        "RAI_IMPORT_DATA_ONLY_FAST_PATH 默认 \"1\"，所以直连车道是默认路径而不是实验开关（apps/api/src/server.ts:168-169）",
        "直连在 BEGIN IMMEDIATE 的同一个事务里落事实、账本、recompute_jobs 任务与 import_manifest 回执，然后一次 COMMIT（apps/api/src/direct-sync-ingest.ts:448-469、509-524、584-587）",
        "解析与归一在同一事务内联执行：parseAppleHealthXml → importGpxRoutes → canonicalizeRunningWorkouts → canonicalizeNightsForWindow（apps/api/src/direct-sync-ingest.ts:461-488）",
        "分析交给 worker 线程：runDirectSyncAnalysis 直接复用 runFullRecompute 的同一套计算与发布 gate（packages/application/src/services/recompute-pipeline.ts:451-453）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "派生计算与发布粒度",
      "items": [
        "runFullRecompute 顺序执行 feature_extraction → training_metrics → model_replay，并分别落 feature_runs / training_metric_runs / model_runs（recompute-pipeline.ts:195-236）",
        "特征写入 workout_features，携带 workout-feature-v4 payload 与 eligibility/coverage（recompute-pipeline.ts:1109-1166）",
        "发布是一次指针 upsert：active_model_run(singleton=1) → model_run_id，并清掉 active prediction model（packages/storage-sqlite/src/model-run-repository.ts:212-218、recompute-pipeline.ts:2371-2383）",
        "读端只通过 active_ability_assessments / active_daily_ability_snapshots 看到已发布 run，未发布的 run 不可见（packages/storage-sqlite/src/database.ts:545-553）",
        "recompute_jobs.status 的取值域是 queued / running / succeeded / failed / cancelled（packages/storage-sqlite/src/database.ts:483-499）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "回退车道：候选库 + rename 换库",
      "items": [
        "直连拒收时回退到维护路径：createCurrentBackup 生成 var/backups/rai.before-web-import.<jobId>.sqlite，再 copyFile 成 var/rai.importing.<jobId>.sqlite（apps/api/src/import-worker.ts:626-645）",
        "解析 CLI 以 --owned-candidate 只允许写这个私有候选库，随后跑 recompute CLI（apps/api/src/import-worker.ts:654-682、739-753）",
        "activateDatabase 先 readStores.beginReplace() 排空读租约，再 rename 候选库为 var/rai.sqlite 并跑一次 quick_check；失败用回滚点恢复（apps/api/src/import-worker.ts:1696-1735）",
        "该路径仍是首次导入与大包分批的路径；启用 Rust 引擎后直连被否决（engine_rust），只能走它（apps/api/src/import-worker.ts:632-635、apps/api/src/direct-sync-plan.ts:51）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "可选件与明确未知",
      "items": [
        "Rust 数据引擎默认关闭：importEngine() 默认返回 typescript，只有 --engine rust 或 RAI_IMPORT_ENGINE=rust 才启用（packages/health-export-parser/src/native-worker.ts:69-72）",
        "启用 rust 且 fallback=none 时找不到二进制会让 server.ts 启动即抛错，不会静默退回 TS（apps/api/src/server.ts:133-136）",
        "Rust 的 apply-records 只写私有候选库且要带一次性 permit，主库永远不由它直接写（native-worker.ts:122-124、native-record-writer.ts:76-87）",
        "预测模型是独立支路：Python 训练产出 model.onnx / feature-schema.json / evaluation.json 并按 SHA-256 校验，再由 active_prediction_model 指针发布（packages/application/src/prediction-training-runner.ts:550-560、prediction-model-service.ts:824-833）",
        "UNKNOWN：仓库不含部署环境变量记录，无法从源码判定线上是否设置 RAI_IMPORT_ENGINE 或 RAI_IMPORT_DATA_ONLY_FAST_PATH，因此两条车道的线上实际占比无法证明"
      ]
    }
  ]
